WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 9d89d6259cdafb0e4850d658df9bd781

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.440
Karibu tena. Umefika kwenye hatua

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.280
muhimu sana katika kozi sasa. Umekuwa ukitumia

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.060
namba na string na Boolean, neno la kifahari

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.500
kwa kweli na sikweli, na hizi

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.350
tunaziita aina za data. Lakini katika video hii,

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.260
tutaongeza aina yetu ya kwanza ya data

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:20.080
mchanganyiko. Yaani aina ya data inayoweza kuwa na

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:23.300
vitu vingi, siyo kitu kimoja tu, na

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.780
aina hii ya data mchanganyiko inaitwa orodha.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.280
Sasa, unaposikia neno orodha,

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.060
nataka ufikirie mnyororo halisi

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.800
unaoshikilia vitu vingi pamoja. Vitu

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.520
vilivyo kwenye mnyororo huo vinaweza kuwa chochote: string, namba, Boolean,

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.360
hata orodha nyingine, hata vitu ambavyo bado

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.280
hujavijifunza, lakini tusijisumbue na hilo

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:47.440
kwa sasa. Kila kitu katika mnyororo huu kiko

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.320
kwa mpangilio, mpangilio ambao vimeunganishwa pamoja.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:54.860
Kwa hiyo orodha ina vitu vingi, lakini

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.800
ni kipengele kimoja kizima, kitu kimoja kizima,

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.440
orodha moja iliyo na vipengele vingi ndani yake.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.090
Jiki anaweza kuchukua orodha hiyo, mnyororo huo, na

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.060
kuuweka kwenye sanduku, kama vile

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.300
anavyoweza kuweka string kwenye sanduku au

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.580
namba kwenye sanduku. Anaweza

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.340
kuiweka kwenye tundu la ingizo la mashine.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.320
Anaweza kuitoa kwenye mteremko

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.860
wa matokeo. Orodha hii ni kitu kimoja, na Jiki

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.800
anafanya kazi nayo kwa njia ile ile

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.840
anavyofanya kazi na string, namba, na kila kitu kingine

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:27.920
ulichokiona hadi sasa. Sasa, kwenye msimbo, orodha

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.240
inaonekana kwa kiasi fulani kama mnyororo pia.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.420
Ina mabano ya mraba kila upande

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.770
na kisha vitu vingi vilivyounganishwa

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.420
pamoja, vikitenganishwa kwa koma. Kwa mfano, kama

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.590
tunataka kuunda orodha yenye

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.480
majina ya baadhi ya washiriki wa bootcamp yetu,

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.440
tunaweza kuandaa sanduku linaloitwa mentors (washauri)

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.260
na kuweka mnyororo huo ndani yake.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:52.900
Tungeandika let mentors =, sawa kabisa

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.300
na tunavyofanya na sanduku jingine lolote, na

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.860
kisha tunapata mabano ya mraba ya kufungua, vipengele

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.480
vingi, majina yao yakitenganishwa kwa koma, na

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.700
mwisho mabano ya mraba ya kufunga. Jiki anapoona

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.730
hivi, anaenda kuchukua karatasi

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.760
nne, moja kwa kila jina, kisha anachukua

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.650
mnyororo mpya na kuunganisha zote pamoja, na

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.800
kisha anaweka mnyororo huo kwenye sanduku

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.580
la mentors. Unaweza kuweka kitu chochote kwenye orodha: string,

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.820
namba, Boolean, hata mchanganyiko wa vitu. Hizi

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.900
zote ni mifano tofauti ya orodha halali kabisa.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:27.320
Unaweza pia kuunda orodha tupu.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.080
Ni mnyororo tu usio na vipengele. Bado

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:31.760
ni kitu halisi. Bado una ncha

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:33.800
zake zote mbili. Bado ni mnyororo. Ni kwamba

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.160
tu hauna vitu ndani yake. Lakini

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.400
bado unaweza kuweka orodha hii tupu

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.260
kwenye sanduku na kuitoa na

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:44.120
kuitumia baadaye. Sawa, kwa hiyo unaweza kuunda

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.850
orodha kwa mtindo wa mabano ya mraba, lakini

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.820
tunazitumiaje kwa kweli? Tunaangaliaje

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.910
kilicho ndani yao na kutoa

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.829
vitu? Ni kwa njia ile ile tuliyotumia

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.410
tulipotaka kutoa herufi kutoka

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:58.040
kwenye string. Tunaweza kutumia mabano ya mraba

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.980
tukiweka namba ndani. Hebu turudi

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:03.020
kwenye orodha yetu ya washauri. Tukitaka

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.560
kumtoa wa kwanza, tunaandika

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:08.720
mentors[0]. Kumbuka kwamba tunaanza kuhesabu

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:13.280
kutoka sifuri katika JavaScript. Na tunaweza pia

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.190
kufanya marudio kwenye orodha kwa njia ile ile

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:18.460
tuliyofanya marudio kwenye string hapo awali, kwa kutumia for-of.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.580
Orodha zinafanya kazi kwa njia ile ile. Tofauti

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.980
pekee ni kwamba wakati huu, badala ya

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.720
kutoa herufi, tunatoa kile kilichokuwa

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.900
kipengele kwenye orodha. Katika mfano huu,

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:31.620
jina la mshauri. Kwa hiyo mara ya kwanza

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.280
tunapomshukuru mtu, tunamshukuru DJ. Mara ya pili,

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:38.400
tunamshukuru Becky, na kadhalika. Tunaweza

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:41.500
pia kutumia sifa length kwenye orodha,

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.940
kama tulivyojifunza kuhusu string. Kama

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:45.980
tuna orodha yenye string nne kwenye

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:50.040
sanduku la mentors na tunaandika mentors.length, itarejesha nne.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:53.500
Na tunaweza kutumia includes vivyo hivyo

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.180
kwenye orodha pia. Tunaweza kusema

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.880
mentors.includes("DJ"), nayo itarejesha true. Lakini

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.600
tukisema mentors.includes("Frank"), itarejesha false.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.360
Kila kitu kinafanya kazi sawa kabisa na kwenye string.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.640
Ni kwamba tu tunafanya kazi na vipengele vya

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.160
orodha, siyo herufi za string.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.160
Mazoezi mawili yajayo yatakufanya ujaribu

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.540
mbinu hizi tofauti. Utahitaji

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.130
kufikiri kama unahitaji kutoa

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.680
kipengele kimoja kutoka kwenye orodha kwa kutumia

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:26.220
mtindo wa mabano ya mraba, au kama unataka

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.820
kupitia vipengele vyote kwa kitanzi, ukikagua au ukishughulikia

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.860
kila kimoja kwa zamu. Kama kawaida, ukikwama,

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.040
angalia vidokezo, na tutaonana

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:34.860
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
